Source code for the experimental port of the gdx-video API to Arc.

All the classes and the 'jni' folder originate from that project, with changes to the classes to use Arc instead of libGDX.

This is experimental and very likely, unstable. Use at your own risk.

Some key differences:
- The dav1d and FFmpeg sources are updated to their latest commits. I tried using the same commit tags as gdx-video, but it just consistently kept crashing.
- iOS support is removed. This is primarily for Mindustry Java mods to use, and iOS doesn't support those.
- Natives for 32-bit Windows/Linux and ARM64 Linux aren't included by default. (Mindustry dropped 32-bit support and Arc isn't being compiled for ARM64 Linux.)